---
// Varlen packed prefill: prompts packed into a 128-token tile; block-diagonal causal mask (queries x keys).
---
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 340" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <rect class="d-bg" x="0" y="0" width="760" height="340" rx="12" />
  <text class="d-label" x="30" y="32">PADDED (BEFORE): 64 TOKENS PER PROMPT</text>
  <g>
    <rect class="d-accent" x="30" y="44" width="90" height="26" rx="4" /><rect class="d-box" x="120" y="44" width="70" height="26" rx="4" />
    <rect class="d-green" x="196" y="44" width="70" height="26" rx="4" /><rect class="d-box" x="266" y="44" width="90" height="26" rx="4" />
    <rect class="d-amber" x="362" y="44" width="110" height="26" rx="4" /><rect class="d-box" x="472" y="44" width="50" height="26" rx="4" />
    <text class="d-mono" x="532" y="62">3 prompts → 192 tokens, 45% padding</text>
  </g>
  <text class="d-label" x="30" y="102">PACKED (VARLEN): ONE 128-TOKEN TILE</text>
  <g>
    <rect class="d-accent" x="30" y="114" width="90" height="26" rx="4" />
    <rect class="d-green" x="120" y="114" width="70" height="26" rx="4" />
    <rect class="d-amber" x="190" y="114" width="110" height="26" rx="4" />
    <rect class="d-box" x="300" y="114" width="56" height="26" rx="4" />
    <text class="d-mono" x="366" y="132">same 3 prompts → 1 tile</text>
  </g>

  <!-- mask -->
  <text class="d-label" x="30" y="174">MASK [QUERIES × KEYS]: SAME PROMPT AND KEY ≤ QUERY</text>
  <rect class="d-box" x="30" y="186" width="140" height="140" rx="4" />
  <path class="d-accent" d="M30 186 L30 230 L74 230 Z" />
  <path class="d-green" d="M74 230 L74 264 L108 264 Z" />
  <path class="d-amber" d="M108 264 L108 318 L162 318 Z" />
  <text class="d-small" x="190" y="206">Fresh prompts have no earlier context: every key is a</text>
  <text class="d-small" x="190" y="224">token of this step, so attention runs on q / k / v</text>
  <text class="d-small" x="190" y="242">already in SBUF — no cache reads, no K transposes.</text>
  <text class="d-small" x="190" y="270">Queries on partitions, keys on the free axis:</text>
  <text class="d-small" x="190" y="288">S = Q·Kᵀ → + mask → softmax along the free axis →</text>
  <text class="d-small" x="190" y="306">Pᵀ (one transpose) → V·Pᵀ, 4 heads per pass.</text>
</svg>
